---
---

<section class="py-20 bg-[#F4F6F0] border-y border-gray-200/80 relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Subtle Background Pattern -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#0F5A47 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;"></div>

  <div class="container-1440 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide border border-red-200">
        <span>The Digital Reality</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">
        Common Marketing Problems <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-[#0F5A47]">Every Business Should Solve</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed font-normal">
        Many business owners spend money creating a social media page or setting up a basic website, only to discover that visitors leave without reaching out. If potential customers cannot find you or do not trust your platform, digital channels fail to produce growth.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Common Friction Points (Elevated White Cards on Highlight Background) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mt-16">
      
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#0F5A47] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl group-hover:bg-[#0F5A47] group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.875 18.825A10.05 10.05 0 0112 19c-4.478 0-8.268-2.943-9.543-7a9.97 9.97 0 011.563-3.029m5.858-5.908a10.025 10.025 0 014.122-.863c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.543 7a10.025 10.025 0 01-4.132 5.411m0 0L21 21M3 3l18 18"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-[#0F5A47] transition-colors leading-snug">Low Search Visibility</h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          When customers search Google for your services in Siliguri or regionally, your website is nowhere to be found on the first page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#0F5A47] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-orange-100 text-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl group-hover:bg-[#0F5A47] group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-[#0F5A47] transition-colors leading-snug">Traffic Without Enquiries</h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          People visit your website or social media pages, but they leave immediately without filling out a form, messaging, or calling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#0F5A47] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl group-hover:bg-[#0F5A47] group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-[#0F5A47] transition-colors leading-snug">Unfocused Ad Spend</h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Running paid ads on Facebook or Google without a strategic landing page and audience framework wastes budget without bringing real leads.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#0F5A47] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl group-hover:bg-[#0F5A47] group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-[#0F5A47] transition-colors leading-snug">Outdated Website Design</h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          An outdated or slow website hurts brand credibility. Modern customers expect fast loading, clear answers, and seamless mobile access.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Reassurance Banner -->
    <div class="mt-12 p-7 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-[#0F5A47]/20 shadow-md flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 text-center md:text-left">
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Sound Familiar? You Are Not Alone.</h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 font-normal">The good news is that these challenges are entirely solvable with a structured digital growth approach.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="#growth-framework" class="inline-flex items-center px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0F5A47] text-white text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold hover:bg-[#0A3E31] transition-all shadow-md shrink-0">
        <span>See How Growth Works</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
